        <mxCell id="vpc_ep" value="" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#8C4FFF;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.endpoints;" vertex="1" parent="vpc">
          <mxGeometry x="34" y="30" width="34" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vpc_hdr" value="Route tables: public (0.0.0.0/0 to the internet gateway prod01-us-network-igw; public and bastion subnets), private (0.0.0.0/0 to the one NAT gateway), internal (local only). S3 gateway endpoint on all three route tables; no interface endpoints. NACLs: VPC default. Flow logs: REJECT only. Zones: first three available, use1-az3 excluded (EKS rejects cluster subnets there). Unallocated: 10.144.220.0 to 10.144.255.255 and the rest of 10.144.204.0/22." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#545B64;" vertex="1" parent="vpc">
          <mxGeometry x="76" y="27" width="648" height="46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
