        <mxCell id="bastion" value="&lt;b&gt;Bastion&lt;/b&gt; t4g.small Graviton Spot, AL2023: SSM Session Manager only, no SSH (bastion_allowed_cidrs empty); IMDSv2; Ansible installs the SSM agent, kubectl, helm; egress only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#687078&quot;&gt;prod01-us-east-1/network&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=46;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="bas1">
