      <mxCell id="e_b9" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#1E8900;exitX=0.05;exitY=1.0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.65;entryY=0.0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tg1" target="ofapi"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lam" value="&lt;b&gt;Regional failover function&lt;/b&gt;: Lambda in us-west-2, arm64, 256 MB, 900 s, reserved concurrency 1, running the of-failover image at the commit its CI pushed&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#687078&quot;&gt;prod01-us-west-2/failover/lambda-regional-failover&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Targets from the Secrets Manager secret prod01-usw2-failover-regional: the global database, both cluster ARNs, both accelerator endpoint group ARNs. Actions: ping, status, fence (the failed region's endpoint group dial to 0), failover (rds:FailoverGlobalCluster to the standby) and switchover (planned, rds:SwitchoverGlobalCluster). A CloudWatch alarm event maps to on_alarm, status today; no alarm is wired in code, so an operator runs aws lambda invoke. Rights: globalaccelerator Describe and UpdateEndpointGroup, rds Describe, FailoverGlobalCluster, SwitchoverGlobalCluster, secretsmanager:GetSecretValue." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=44;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="1786" width="1300" height="104" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lam_i" value="" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.lambda_function;" vertex="1" parent="lam"><mxGeometry x="8" y="8" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_fo_ga" value="fence: the failed region's endpoint group dial to 0" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontSize=9;fontColor=#ED7100;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.04;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lam" target="ga"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="983" y="1770" /><mxPoint x="912" y="1770" /><mxPoint x="912" y="810" /><mxPoint x="747" y="810" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_fo_aurora" value="promote the standby of the global database" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontSize=9;fontColor=#ED7100;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.6;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.6;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lam" target="aurora"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="reg_w" value="Region us-west-2: the standby, built from the same code" style="shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_region;outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;strokeColor=#00A4A6;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#147EBA;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
